asciicam (0.3.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add --prof, which prints per-stage frame timing (average, p50,
    p99, max and share of frame time) when the program exits.
  * Add --bench <n>, which renders n frames without the frame limiter
    and prints the same table. Pair it with --demo to measure without
    a camera.
  * Add the optflow plugin: Lucas-Kanade motion arrows, with a
    coarse-to-fine pyramid for motion up to about 8 px per frame.
  * Write colour escapes without printf (nl_sgr).
  * Fix the nolibc umbrella header so library headers are included in
    one place.

